      "updated": 1793604380555,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "理想独立重叠：T ≥ max(Q / BW, F / P)\n因此 F/T ≤ min(P, (F/Q) × BW)\n实际还会受依赖、发出、同步和小任务开销限制",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "理想独立重叠：T ≥ max(Q / BW, F / P)\n因此 F/T ≤ min(P, (F/Q) × BW)\n实际还会受依赖、发出、同步和小任务开销限制",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
